      "title": "Keep the review sheet's Agent columns current",
      "description": "Whenever an agent works on a change set of a folio whose review sheet is kept by the Tool `review-sheet-sync`, it writes the Agent tabs' columns for that change set and its comments as it goes: status, step, what it did, the PR, the staging page and its build, what the PR changed and when it finished. Use on every change-set edit, draft, PR, push, merge or close, in a sheet sync or not.",
